<title>USA: North Carolina hogs - buyer station prices close.</title>
<headline>North Carolina hogs - buyer station prices close.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Posted base prices, in dollars per cwt, for 220-260-lb hogs at packer buying stations as reported by the North Carolina Department of Agriculture.</p>
<p>   Hot carcass basis* - Up $0.66	    Thursday  Prev</p>
<p>    Kinston, Spivey's Corner, Siler	  72.85    72.19</p>
<p>City, Wilson, Robersonville</p>
<p>Live sow basis - steady to up $1.50</p>
<p>    Fayetteville				   52.00</p>
<p>    Wallace					  54.50</p>
<p>    Rowland					  54.00</p>
<p>    Spivey's Corner				52.00</p>
<p>*Grade/yield is on 167-187 lb carcasses yielding 48 pct lean with less than 1.15 inches backfat at 10th rib.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720--</p>
